// tests/imported/pass/lifetimes/mut-slice-struct-lifetime-transmute--c17-samelt
// (`y: &i64` -> `y: &'a i64`), which RUNS and asserts its exit code.
// RE-PORTED AS-IS 2026-09-08 (stage 6). THE OLD PORT WAS THE WRONG HALF OF THE
// UPSTREAM FILE: it wrote the ARRAY door again (`out[0] = y` on `[&i64; 1]`), and
// without the reborrow hop, so this file and its `--t17` sibling were two
// near-copies of one program. Upstream line 17 onwards — which is what `--c17`
